mbiguate with the module (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrigamiPatterns.Interaction"},{"text":") if it ever collides. This one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"doesn’t clash with anything in SwiftUI.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Exposes the Interaction patch’s output ports as bindings\/callbacks so downstream SwiftUI","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"composes off them, matching the graph:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"down"},{"text":" — ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" while a finger is on the layer,","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"position"},{"type":"text","text":" — the touch point, in the layer’s coordinate space,"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"onTap","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"onDoubleTap","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"onLongPress","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — discrete pulses.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only the gesture for an output you actually request is attached — so a tap-only layer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carries only a tap recognizer (no stray drag), which keeps gesture arbitration clean."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swami\/interaction"]}],"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction/ViewModifier-Implementations":{"abstract":[],"kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","url":"\/documentation\/